      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention may also be useful for high-temperature applications.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitations are the structural mediator of the proposed property improvement.",
